  "description": "Audio DSP library implementing RVQ neural codec (3-8 kbps), psychoacoustic ATH masking, Chebyshev harmonic exciter, virtual bass synthesis, 3D binaural HRTF spatializer, LPC-16 packet loss concealment, 10-band equalizer, MDCT/IMDCT TDAC, WSOLA pitch shifter, FLAC lossless decoder, fast convolution reverb, NMF source separation, TKVA frame-streaming decoder, and SIMD hardware vectorization (AVX2/FMA). All 23 modules written in pure TokenVector (.tkv).",
